  m_text: "Game by Sahil Goel, Joenna Yaya, Sara Voong, and Wing Sum Siu\nArt Assets
    created by Joenna Yaya (Intro, Forest, Ending - Krita) & Sara Voong (Baking -
    Google Drawings) & Wing Sum Siu (Bird - Piskel, Keybind indicators - Google Drawings)\nSound
    Effect Assets created by Sara Voong (Baking Sound Effect) \nMusic Assets created
    by Sara Voong (Garage Band)\n\nTutorial Credits:\n(Text dialogue)\n5 Minute DIALOGUE
    SYSTEM in UNITY Tutorial\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8oTYabhj248\n\n(Dialogue
    trigger if player is close)\nUNITY 2D NPC DIALOGUE SYSTEM TUTORIAL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1nFNOyCalzo
    \n\n(Drag and Drop)\nDrag & Drop 2D | World-Space 2D Objects | C# | Unity Game
    Engine:\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CKQY8MdtBLI \n\n(4-way grid-based movement)\nHow
